 ;; --- what this contract does NOT say ------------------------------------
 :not-claimed
 ["That the committed objects reproduce byte-for-byte from their recorded
   sources at their recorded compiler revisions. That is measured separately
   and is currently false for most of them (ADR-0129,
   qualification/object-producer-measurement.edn)."
  "That the TCP candidate, complete HTTPS or Qwen runtime has passed on the
   physical K16. QEMU has no RTL8125 and proves only the bounded no-device
   branch; the separate 5A evidence proves the preceding ARP/UDP artifact."
  "That 32 is a count of C SOURCE files. It is a count of objects in one
   link."]}
